Welcome to Pelangi Capsule Hostel self check-in guide.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
This video will walk you through the check-in process step by step.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 1: Arrive at Pelangi Capsule Hostel, Johor Bahru.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Look for the main entrance with the Pelangi signage.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 2: Use the door access code sent to your phone.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Enter the code on the keypad to unlock the main door.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
[Door unlocking sound]

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Step 3: Find your assigned pod number.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Check your booking confirmation for your pod assignment.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Step 4: Connect to Wi-Fi.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
The Wi-Fi network name and password are displayed inside your pod.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Enjoy your stay at Pelangi Capsule Hostel!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
For any questions, contact us via WhatsApp.

